# The Dockerfiles copy only package manifests, packages/contracts and their own app, but Docker
# still sends the whole context first. Without this file that was ~5 GB per build (backups,
# node_modules, .next) and enough to exhaust memory on a workstation.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
backups
minio
docs
scripts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/test
**/coverage
